      "name": "Automatic Transfer Switch (ATS)",
      "brand": "MGM",
      "category": "Power Management System",
      "description": "Smart standalone panel that automatically switches between power sources. The ATS panel is connected with MGM Generators through signal wires and power cables. It communicates with two power sources and outputs one of them. For example, in Malaysia, this ATS panel can be connected to the Main Grid Power (Tenaga Nasional Berhad) and an MGM Generator. It will automatically command the generator to start when the main power fails and perform automatic changeover of power source.",
